      "slot": 5,
      "description": "Validate a Canadian postal code. Rules:\n- Must be six characters long, either as 'A1A1A1' or with a single space after the third character: 'A1A 1A1'.\n- The first, third, and fifth characters must be uppercase letters.\n- The second, fourth, and sixth characters must be digits.\n- The letters allowed are A, B, C, E, G, H, J, K, L, M, N, P, R, S, T, V, W, X, Y, Z (D, F, I, O, Q, U are excluded).\n- No leading or trailing spaces, and no other separators.",
      "regex": "/^[ABCEGHJKLMNPRSTVWXYZ]\\d[ABCEGHJKLMNPRSTVWXYZ] ?\\d[ABCEGHJKLMNPRSTVWXYZ]\\d$/i"
