      "description": "Password rules: length between 8 and 64 characters. Must contain at least one uppercase letter, one lowercase letter, one digit, and one special character from the set !@#$%^&*()_+-=[]{};':\",./<>? . The password must not contain the substring 'password' in any case combination (case-insensitive).",
      "regex": "/^(?!.*password)(?=.*[a-z])(?=.*[A-Z])(?=.*\\d)(?=.*[!@#$%^&*()_+\\-=\\[\\]{};':\",./<>?])[A-Za-z\\d!@#$%^&*()_+\\-=\\[\\]{};':\",./<>?]{8,64}$/i"
    },
