      "description": "Match a time in 12-hour format with AM/PM. The time consists of an hour from 1 to 12, followed by a colon, then exactly two digits for minutes (00 to 59). Optionally, a colon and two digits for seconds (00 to 59) may follow. After the time, there must be a space and then either 'AM' or 'PM' in uppercase. The entire string must match this pattern.",
