      "slot": 1,
      "description": "Our shipping system needs to validate US ZIP codes entered by customers. It should accept either a standard 5-digit ZIP code or a ZIP+4 code where the extra four digits are separated by a hyphen. Only the format is checked, not whether the ZIP actually exists.",
