      "description": "We're adding a .env file validator for our deployment pipeline. The ops team requires that environment variable names start with an uppercase letter, may contain uppercase letters, digits, and underscores, and must not end with an underscore. Also, leading underscores are not allowed, and consecutive underscores are forbidden.",
