items.description:
Unicode personal name validator. A valid name must:
- be 1 to 100 code points long, using Unicode-aware counting;
- contain only letters (any Unicode letter), combining marks, spaces, hyphens, and apostrophes;
- start and end with a letter (not a space, hyphen, apostrophe, or combining mark);
- never contain two consecutive hyphens, two consecutive apostrophes, or two consecutive spaces;
- allow single spaces, hyphens, or apostrophes as internal separators only when surrounded by letters, but not more than one separator in a row;
- reject leading or trailing whitespace;
- reject strings with any control characters or punctuation other than the allowed separators.

