      "description": "We need to validate the price field in our Japanese storefront. The accepted input is a whole-yen amount: digits only, no decimal part and no decimal separator. A leading zero is only allowed for the amount zero itself; otherwise the first digit must be 1-9. Amounts must be between 1 and 999,999 yen inclusive. No currency symbol, no grouping separators, and no plus sign.",
