      "slot": 2,
      "description": "A semantic version number consists of three numeric parts separated by dots, followed optionally by a pre-release suffix and optionally by build metadata. The pre-release suffix starts with a hyphen and consists of dot-separated identifiers, each containing only alphanumeric characters and hyphens. The build metadata starts with a plus sign and consists of dot-separated identifiers, each containing only alphanumeric characters and hyphens. Numeric identifiers in the pre-release part must not have leading zeros unless they are exactly zero. The build metadata identifiers may have leading zeros. The major, minor, and patch numbers must not have leading zeros unless they are exactly zero.",
      "regex": "/^(0|[1-9]\\d*)\\.(0|[1-9]\\d*)\\.(0|[1-9]\\d*)(?:-((?:0|[1-9]\\d*|\\d*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9]\\d*|\\d*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*))?(?:\\+([0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*))?$/"
    },
    {
      "slot": 3,
      "description": "A valid semantic version string must match the following format: major, minor, and patch are non-negative integers without leading zeros, separated by dots. An optional pre-release version may follow, starting with a hyphen, then a series of dot-separated identifiers. Each identifier may consist of alphanumeric characters and hyphens, but must not be empty. Numeric identifiers in the pre-release must not have leading zeros. An optional build metadata may follow, starting with a plus sign, then a series of dot-separated identifiers. Each identifier may consist of alphanumeric characters and hyphens, but must not be empty. Build metadata identifiers may have leading zeros. The pre-release and build metadata are both optional and may appear together, with the pre-release always before the build metadata.",
      "regex": "/^(0|[1-9]\\d*)\\.(0|[1-9]\\d*)\\.(0|[1-9]\\d*)(?:-((?:0|[1-9]\\d*|\\d*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9]\\d*|\\d*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*))?(?:\\+([0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*))?$/"
    },
    {
      "slot": 4,
      "description": "Match a semantic version number: three dot-separated numeric parts without leading zeros, optionally followed by a pre-release part starting with a hyphen and consisting of dot-separated alphanumeric identifiers (which may include hyphens), and optionally followed by build metadata starting with a plus sign and consisting of dot-separated alphanumeric identifiers (which may include hyphens).",
      "regex": "/^(0|[1-9]\\d*)\\.(0|[1-9]\\d*)\\.(0|[1-9]\\d*)(?:-[0-9A-Za-z-]+(?:\\.[0-9A-Za-z-]+)*)?(?:\\+[0-9A-Za-z-]+(?:\\.[0-9A-Za-z-]+)*)?$/"
    },
