      "slot": 3,
      "description": "Please validate an email address in a practical way for our contact form. It should have a local part with letters, numbers, dots, underscores, percent signs, plus signs, and hyphens, followed by an @ symbol, then a domain with letters and numbers separated by dots, and a top-level domain of at least two letters. The domain must not start or end with a hyphen.",
      "regex": "/^[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9](?:[A-Za-z0-9-]*[A-Za-z0-9])?(?:\\.[A-Za-z0-9](?:[A-Za-z0-9-]*[A-Za-z0-9])?)*\\.[A-Za-z]{2,}$/"
