      "slot": 3,
      "description": "A passphrase must satisfy all of the following:\n- It consists of exactly 4 words separated by single spaces.\n- Each word contains only lowercase letters (a-z).\n- The words must all be distinct (no word is repeated).\n- The entire passphrase must be at least 15 characters long (including spaces).",
      "regex": "/^(?=.{15,}$)([a-z]+) (?![a-z]+(?: |$))(?:([a-z]+) (?![a-z]+(?: |$))(?:(?!\\1\\b)(?!\\2\\b)[a-z]+) (?:(?!\\1\\b)(?!\\2\\b)(?!\\3\\b)[a-z]+))$/"
