    {
      "slot": 1,
      "description": "A valid name must consist of one or more words separated by single spaces. Each word must start with a letter from any script (including letters with diacritics or non-Latin scripts), followed by zero or more letters from any script, hyphens, or apostrophes. The entire string must contain at least one letter. The string must not start or end with a space, hyphen, or apostrophe, and must not contain consecutive spaces, hyphens, or apostrophes.",
