      "description": "Validate a US dollar amount with optional cents. Rules:\n- Must start with a dollar sign.\n- Then any integer amount from 0 to 999999, with no leading zeros unless the amount is exactly zero.\n- May optionally be followed by a decimal point and exactly two digits (cents).\n- No other characters allowed.",
