      "description": "Validate a negative monetary amount in accounting format. The string must start with an opening parenthesis, followed by a dollar sign, followed by a numeric amount. The numeric amount must not have leading zeros unless it is zero, may optionally include a comma-separated thousands part, and must include exactly two decimal digits after a decimal point. Then a closing parenthesis. No spaces or other characters are allowed.",
