      "description": "cal ver yyyy.mm.dd optional with patch? actually: year.month where month 01-12 and optional .day 01-31? but that's calendar fact. Let's say: calendar version with year and month, optional day, year 4 digits, month 01-12, day 01-31, separated by dots.",
      "regex": "/^\\d{4}\\.(0[1-9]|1[0-2])(?:\\.(0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01]))?$/"
