      "description": "Our inventory import tool receives a raw field that must be a JSON array containing only whole numbers (no fractions, no exponents), with no spaces or line breaks anywhere, since a downstream legacy parser rejects any whitespace. An empty array is acceptable, and each number may be negative. Anything else, including nested arrays or text values, must be rejected before the record is queued.",
      "regex": "/^\\[(?:-?\\d+(?:,-?\\d+)*)?\\]$/"
