      "slot": 2,
      "description": "A valid file name must consist of one or more characters from the set: letters (A-Z, a-z), digits (0-9), underscore, hyphen, and dot. The dot is allowed only as a separator and must not be the first or last character, and consecutive dots are not allowed. The name must not contain any whitespace characters. The whole input is the file name.",
