      "slot": 3,
      "description": "Match an image file name that ends with a common image extension: .jpg, .jpeg, .png, .gif, .bmp, .webp, or .svg, case-insensitive. The extension must be preceded by a dot, and the file name part before that dot must be at least one character long and must not contain any forward slash or backslash. The whole string is the file name.",
