      "description": "Validate an ISO 8601 timestamp with timezone. The date must be in the format YYYY-MM-DD, where YYYY is exactly four digits, MM is a two-digit month from 01 to 12, and DD is a two-digit day from 01 to 31. The time must be in the format HH:MM:SS, where HH is a two-digit hour from 00 to 23, and MM and SS are two-digit minutes and seconds from 00 to 59. The seconds are required. The timezone must be either 'Z' (for UTC) or ±HH:MM, where HH is from 00 to 23 and MM is from 00 to 59. The timestamp must be the entire string.",
      "regex": "/^\\d{4}-(0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])T([01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d:[0-5]\\d(Z|[+-]([01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d)$/"
