    {
      "slot": 1,
      "description": "Our European logistics dashboard accepts delivery scheduling input. The date field must be a complete calendar date in European order: day first, then month, then year, separated by slashes. Each part must always be written with its full digit count: day and month as two digits and year as four digits, including leading zeros. Do not validate whether the date actually exists (such as February 30th); only the written pattern is checked here.",
