      "description": "Our uploader must accept a file name that does not contain any of the characters forbidden on Windows: backslash, forward slash, colon, asterisk, question mark, double quote, less-than, greater-than, or pipe. Also the name must not be empty and must not start or end with a space.",
      "regex": "/^(?! )[^\\\\\\/:*?\"<>|]+(?<! )$/"
