      "description": "A simplified five-field cron expression: fields for minute, hour, day of month, month, and day of week, separated by single spaces. Each field must be an asterisk (*) or a single number without leading zeros, within the standard bounds: minute 0-59, hour 0-23, day of month 1-31, month 1-12, day of week 0-7.",
