3. The host may optionally be preceded by userinfo in the form user:password@ where both parts are made of URL-safe characters.
4. A port may follow the host, written as a colon and one to five digits, and its value must be between 1 and 65535.
5. After the host there may be a path beginning with a slash, made of segments containing letters, digits, hyphens, underscores, dots, tildes, percent signs and other URL-safe punctuation.
6. A query string beginning with ? and a fragment beginning with # may follow, each made of characters other than spaces, quotes, angle brackets and control characters.
7. No whitespace anywhere.", "regex": "/^(?:https?):\/\/(?:[A-Za-z0-9._~!$&'()*+,;=:-]+@)?(?:[A-Za-z0-9](?:[A-Za-z0-9-]*[A-Za-z0-9])?\.)+[A-Za-z]{2,}(?::(?:[1-9]\d{0,3}|[1-5]\d{4}|6[0-4]\d{3}|65[0-4]\d{2}|655[0-2]\d|6553[0-5]))?(?:\/[A-Za-z0-9._~%!$&'()*+,;=:@-]*)*(?:\?[^\s"'<>]*)?(?:#[^\s"'<>]*)?$/i"}, {"slot": 4, "description": "uk domains, labels 1-63 chars, case-insensitive, ending in .co.uk", "regex": "/^(?:[a-z0-9](?:[a-z0-9-]{0,61}[a-z0-9])?\.)+co\.uk$/i"}, {"slot": 5, "description": "A German .de domain name must satisfy:
- at least one label before the final .de label;
- each label is 1 to 63 characters long, may contain only ASCII letters, digits and hyphens, must not start or end with a hyphen;
- labels are separated by single dots;
- the whole name is at most 255 characters;
- matching is case-insensitive.", "regex": "/^(?=.{1,255}$)(?:[a-z0-9](?:[a-z0-9-]{0,61}[a-z0-9])?\.)+de$/i"}]}

