      "description": "A git tag must match the following format:\n- It starts with a lowercase letter 'v'.\n- It is followed by a version number consisting of two or three dot-separated components.\n- Each component is a non-negative integer without leading zeros.\n- No other characters are allowed.",
      "regex": "/^v(0|[1-9]\\d*)\\.(0|[1-9]\\d*)(\\.(0|[1-9]\\d*))?$/"
