      "description": "As part of a data integration pipeline, we need to validate that date strings coming from external systems conform to the ISO 8601 calendar date format (YYYY-MM-DD). Only the format is checked; the pipeline will handle semantic validation separately. The date must have exactly four digits for the year, two digits for the month (01-12), and two digits for the day (01-31). Separators must be hyphens. No other characters or whitespace are allowed. The entire string must match.",
