{
  "items": [
    {
      "slot": 1,
      "description": "Validate that a string is a French IBAN (International Bank Account Number) in the following format:\n- Must start with the country code 'FR' (case-insensitive).\n- Followed by 2 check digits (0-9).\n- Followed by 10 alphanumeric characters (letters or digits) representing the bank code, branch code, and account number part.\n- Followed by 2 check digits (0-9).\n- Spaces are allowed between any characters (but not at the beginning or end).\n- Total length ignoring spaces must be 27 characters.\n- The string may optionally use uppercase or lowercase letters; case is ignored.\n- The format is checked only; no checksum validation is performed.",
