      "description": "Our release dashboard lists the git tags of our repositories. It must only include tags that follow the versioning convention we agreed on: an optional leading lowercase 'v', followed by either two or three dot-separated numeric components, each component being one or more digits with no leading zero unless it is exactly zero. Tags containing any other characters, extra components, missing components, or malformed numbers are not valid release tags.",
