    },
    {
      "description": "Match a semantic version string: three dot-separated numeric components, each a non-negative integer with no leading zeros unless it is exactly zero. An optional pre-release part may follow, introduced by a hyphen and consisting of one or more dot-separated identifiers, where each identifier contains only alphanumeric characters and hyphens and is non-empty. An optional build metadata part may follow, introduced by a plus sign and consisting of one or more dot-separated identifiers, where each identifier contains only alphanumeric characters and hyphens and is non-empty. The pre-release, if present, must come before the build metadata, and both are optional independently, but the build metadata cannot appear without the hyphen if pre-release is omitted? Wait, actually they can appear independently; but the regex should allow either or both. The pre-release and build metadata are only allowed after the three numeric components.",
      "regex": "/^(0|[1-9]\\d*)\\.(0|[1-9]\\d*)\\.(0|[1-9]\\d*)(?:-([0-9A-Za-z-]+(?:\\.[0-9A-Za-z-]+)*))?(?:\\+([0-9A-Za-z-]+(?:\\.[0-9A-Za-z-]+)*))?$/"
    },
    {
      "description": "A valid semantic version consists of exactly three dot-separated numeric identifiers. Each numeric identifier must be a non-negative integer without leading zeros, except for the single digit zero itself. The version may optionally be followed by a pre-release version indicated by a hyphen and one or more dot-separated identifiers; each identifier must be non-empty and contain only ASCII alphanumeric characters and hyphens. The version may also optionally be followed by build metadata indicated by a plus sign and one or more dot-separated identifiers; each identifier must be non-empty and contain only ASCII alphanumeric characters and hyphens. Pre-release and build metadata are independent; either, both, or neither may be present, but pre-release must precede build metadata if both are present.",
      "regex": "/^(0|[1-9]\\d*)\\.(0|[1-9]\\d*)\\.(0|[1-9]\\d*)(?:-([0-9A-Za-z-]+(?:\\.[0-9A-Za-z-]+)*))?(?:\\+([0-9A-Za-z-]+(?:\\.[0-9A-Za-z-]+)*))?$/"
