      "description": "Validate an RFC 1123 hostname. Rules:\n- The hostname is a series of one or more labels separated by single dots.\n- Each label is 1 to 63 characters long.\n- Each label consists of ASCII letters (a-z, A-Z), digits (0-9), and hyphens (-).\n- A label must not start or end with a hyphen.\n- The entire hostname must be no longer than 253 characters.\n- The hostname must not end with a trailing dot.\nOnly the format is checked; no DNS resolution or special hostnames are considered.",
      "regex": "/^(?=.{1,253}$)(?!-)[A-Za-z0-9-]{1,63}(?<!-)(?:\.(?!-)[A-Za-z0-9-]{1,63}(?<!-))*$/"
    },
