{
  "items": [
    {
      "slot": 1,
      "description": "Our storage dashboard needs to accept file sizes entered by users. Valid entries consist of a non-negative number, optionally with up to one decimal place, followed by exactly one space and a unit from this exact set: B, KB, MB, GB, TB. The unit may be in any mixture of upper and lower case. Numbers may not have leading zeros unless the number is zero itself. Examples of valid entries include '1.5 MB' and '0 B'.",
