      "slot": 1,
      "description": "Our monitoring tool needs to flag failed API responses from the access log. A line is considered a failure if it begins with a protocol version token, followed by a space, then a three-digit status code where the first digit is 4 or 5, then a space and a reason phrase that may be empty. The protocol version is either 'HTTP/1.0' or 'HTTP/1.1'. The reason phrase must consist of zero or more printable ASCII characters (U+0020 to U+007E) and must not contain carriage return or newline. The whole line must match exactly.",
      "regex": "/^HTTP\\/(?:1\\.0|1\\.1) [45]\\d{2} [\\x20-\\x7E]*$/"
    },
    {
      "slot": 2,
      "description": "Identify log lines that report an elapsed time of more than one second. The line must contain a duration value followed by a space and the unit 'ms' (milliseconds), 's' (seconds), or 'min' (minutes). The duration value is a non-negative integer (no leading zeros unless the value is exactly zero) and may have no fractional part. For 'ms', the value must be greater than 1000; for 's', greater than 1; for 'min', greater than 0. The line may contain any other characters before or after the duration, but the duration token must be a separate word delimited by non-word characters or string boundaries.",
      "regex": "/(?:^|[^\\w.])(0*[2-9]\\d{3,}|0*[1-9]\\d{4,}) ms(?=[^\\w]|$)|(?:^|[^\\w.])(0*[2-9]|0*[1-9]\\d+) s(?=[^\\w]|$)|(?:^|[^\\w.])(0*[1-9]\\d*) min(?=[^\\w]|$)/"
    },
    {
      "slot": 3,
      "description": "Our log aggregation pipeline expects every log entry to start with an ISO 8601 timestamp in UTC, like '2023-04-05T12:34:56Z'. The timestamp must be exactly 'YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ssZ' where YYYY is four digits, MM is two digits (01-12), DD is two digits (01-31), HH is two digits (00-23), mm is two digits (00-59), and ss is two digits (00-59). After the timestamp, there must be at least one space character, then any sequence of printable ASCII characters except newline. The whole line must match.",
      "regex": "/^\\d{4}-(?:0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])T(?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d:[0-5]\\dZ [\\x20-\\x7E]*$/"
