    {
      "slot": 3,
      "description": "Validate an npm package name that can be either scoped or unscoped.\n- Unscoped package name: 1 to 214 characters, starts with a lowercase letter, digit, or underscore, and contains only lowercase letters, digits, underscores, hyphens, and periods.\n- Scoped package name: starts with an @ symbol, followed by a scope name, a forward slash, and a package name.\n- Scope name: must start with a lowercase letter or digit, and may contain lowercase letters, digits, hyphens, periods, and underscores.\n- Package name (the part after the slash in a scoped package): must follow the same rules as an unscoped name (start with lowercase letter, digit, or underscore, contain only allowed characters).\n- The total length of the entire name (including @ and slash if scoped) must not exceed 214 characters.\n- No uppercase letters are allowed anywhere.",
