      "description": "In our system, users can choose a short name for their profile, but some words are reserved for internal use. The name must be a single word consisting only of lowercase letters, no spaces or punctuation, and it cannot be any of the following reserved words: admin, root, system, guest, user. If it is one of those, it should be rejected.",
