      "description": "We need to generate unique codes for our internal tracking system. Each code must be exactly 10 characters long and consist only of uppercase letters and digits. However, to avoid confusion with our legacy system, codes must not start with the prefix 'OLD'. It's okay if the code contains 'OLD' elsewhere, just not at the beginning.",
