      "slot": 1,
      "description": "Our internal notes tool needs a validation rule for short multiline notes: the note consists of one to three lines, and the whole note must be non-empty. A line here means any run of characters that does not contain a line break; lines are separated by single newline characters. Do not allow leading or trailing blank lines, and do not allow more than three lines.",
