      "description": "Our desktop app stores user settings in a Windows path with a drive letter. The path must start with a drive letter followed by a colon and a backslash. The drive letter can be uppercase or lowercase. After that, the path consists of one or more components separated by backslashes, where each component is one or more characters that are not backslashes, colons, or the following characters: < > \" | ? * . The path must not end with a backslash. No forward slashes are allowed.",
